Third-party components, none of which are redistributed here
------------------------------------------------------------

The operators implemented here are those tabulated in C. W. Murphy,
arXiv:2005.00059 (JHEP 10 (2020) 174), whose naming and class numbering this
model follows and which should be cited alongside it. That author has no
involvement in this work. The paper is not included here; fetch it from arXiv.

The model files are written by FeynRules (Alloul, Christensen, Degrande, Duhr,
Fuks, arXiv:1310.1921) and read by MadGraph5_aMC@NLO (Alwall et al.,
arXiv:1405.0301) through ALOHA (de Aquino et al., arXiv:1108.2041). The UFO
files under models/ carry the FeynRules boilerplate header that every UFO
carries. Neither FeynRules nor MadGraph is included; install them yourself.

The Standard Model FeynRules file the generator builds on, and the SmeftFR and
SMEFTsim models used for cross-checks, are not included. docs/EXTERNAL.md says
what to fetch and where the generator expects it.
